<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-DEC.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-DEC.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Fern situated at 9.3 north, 139.9 East, in the Philippine Sea is threatening shipping. It is expected to track north-northwestward and slowly intensify through Wednesday. Top winds now near 50 mph could be near 70 mph by 48 hours.</p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS</p>
</text>
